WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.567
-The Trump administration

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:04.868
drafted a truly shocking
executive order

00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:06.801
that would've directed
the secretary of defense

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:09.501
to seize voting machines
after the 2020 election.

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:11.634
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:15.901
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:18.467
Seems like almost every day
we get new details

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:20.267
about the threat
to our democracy posed

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:21.501
by Trump and his cronies

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:23.767
as they plotted to overturn
the 2020 election,

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:26.734
so, naturally,
Fox News has been laser-focused

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:30.000
on the issues
that matter most to Americans.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.167
-The maker of M&amp;M's
is giving the candy

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:34.200
a woke makeover.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.267
-M&amp;M's characters
will be redesigned

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:38.901
for a more
progressive world.

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:40.534
-The parent company
of M&amp;M's

00:00:40.534 --> 00:00:42.167
causing quite the stir

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:44.667
after announcing their candy
mascots will be getting

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:48.300
an "inclusive," woke makeover.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.834
-The green M&amp;M,
you will notice,

00:00:49.834 --> 00:00:51.868
is no longer wearing sexy boots.

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:52.901
[ Laughter ]
Now, she's wearing

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:55.701
sensible sneakers.
Why the change?

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:56.667
Well, according to M&amp;M's...

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:04.334
Because leading women
do not wear sexy boots.

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:06.133
Leading women wear frumpy shoes,

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:07.300
the frumpier the better.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.634
That's the rule.

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:12.334
The brown M&amp;M has "transitioned
from high stilettos

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:14.467
to lower block heels."

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:16.133
Also less sexy.

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:17.601
That's progress.

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:19.000
M&amp;M's will not be satisfied

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.934
until every
last cartoon character

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:24.701
is deeply unappealing
and totally androgynous,

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:26.234
until the moment you wouldn't
want to have a drink

00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:27.767
with any one of them.

00:01:27.767 --> 00:01:28.634
That's the goal.

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:31.367
When you're totally turned off,

00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:32.534
we've achieved equity.

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:33.234
They've won.

00:01:33.234 --> 00:01:35.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.267 --> 00:01:38.634
-[ As Carlson ]
This used to be a country

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:40.701
where you could get aroused
by candy,

00:01:40.701 --> 00:01:43.133
where you, a hot-blooded youth,

00:01:43.133 --> 00:01:44.801
could be watching TV
with your girlfriend

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:46.767
and the green M&amp;M
would come onscreen

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:49.834
with her full lips
and her tantalizing white boots

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:51.200
and you'd have
to excuse yourself

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.868
to take a cold shower
or go for a long bike ride.

00:01:53.868 --> 00:01:55.968
And, the next morning,
your girlfriend would say,

00:01:55.968 --> 00:01:57.467
"Are you okay?
You seem distant."

00:01:57.467 --> 00:01:58.968
And you wouldn't have the heart
to tell her

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:01.267
that you were distant
because you no longer felt

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:04.234
any attraction to her dull,
flesh-colored human face,

00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:07.467
as you now realized a truth
that is self-evident --

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:10.300
pure sexuality comes in a green,
button-shaped package

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:11.634
with an alluring candy shell.

00:02:11.634 --> 00:02:14.000
So, instead, you say,
"Everything's fine, sweetie,"

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.167
and you'd drive to work,

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:16.367
but you'd stop
at the convenience store --

00:02:16.367 --> 00:02:17.801
to buy a paper,
you would tell yourself.

00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:20.667
But, once inside,
you'd also grab a bag of candy

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:22.968
and you'd walk to the register
praying that bag

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:24.901
wouldn't slip out of your
sweat-soaked palms.

00:02:24.901 --> 00:02:27.434
And, when you paid,
hands shaking and breath quick,

00:02:27.434 --> 00:02:30.300
the cashier would look at you
and give you a knowing nod

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:35.934
because, as an American man,
he understood what you wanted --

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:38.033
to [bleep] a piece of candy.

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:40.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:40.267 --> 00:02:41.767
[ Cheering ]

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:51.300
And I'm sorry to say we don't
live in that country anymore.

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:52.834
So that's what Fox News
was focused on

00:02:52.834 --> 00:02:54.467
as the rest of us
digested the news

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:55.868
that Trump and his cronies

00:02:55.868 --> 00:02:57.934
had crafted a plan
to seize voting machines,

00:02:57.934 --> 00:02:59.601
a plan that was, apparently,
so advanced,

00:02:59.601 --> 00:03:01.934
they'd written up
a draft executive order

00:03:01.934 --> 00:03:03.267
that involved the military.

00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:05.334
-The January 6th Committee
now has access

00:03:05.334 --> 00:03:08.200
to a trove of Donald Trump's
White House records.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.667
Among them,
according to Politico,

00:03:10.667 --> 00:03:12.501
a draft executive order

00:03:12.501 --> 00:03:16.400
to seize voting machines
and keep him in office.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.067
-Do you have proof
that there was someone

00:03:19.067 --> 00:03:21.934
inside the United States
military,

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:24.834
working on this premise

00:03:24.834 --> 00:03:27.801
of actually seizing
voting machines?

00:03:27.801 --> 00:03:31.000
-Well, we have information that,

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.767
between the
Department of Justice,

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:36.167
a plan was put forth

00:03:36.167 --> 00:03:40.167
to potentially seize
voting machines in the country

00:03:40.167 --> 00:03:44.567
and utilize
Department of Defense assets

00:03:44.567 --> 00:03:46.200
to make that happen.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.400
-But I'm not going to melt
in your hand.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.734
[ Laughter ]
I'm going to melt in your mouth.

00:03:50.734 --> 00:03:52.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.267 --> 00:03:54.033
-Do you, uh, do you promise?

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:55.234
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:56.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.868 --> 00:03:58.100
You guys got to give me
a heads-up

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.834
when the clips are about to end.
Jesus.

00:04:02.434 --> 00:04:04.400
[ Laughter ]
Now, where were "me"? Right.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:06.667
I'm not often shocked
by Trump's antics anymore,

00:04:06.667 --> 00:04:08.634
but I have to say this
strikes me as a pretty big deal.

00:04:08.634 --> 00:04:09.734
It's one thing,
to have a meeting

00:04:09.734 --> 00:04:10.901
with a bunch of crazy people,

00:04:10.901 --> 00:04:12.601
like Rudy or the pillow lunatic

00:04:12.601 --> 00:04:16.501
or that lawyer who looks like
she kidnapped 101 Dalmatians,

00:04:16.501 --> 00:04:18.934
only to find out later
they were actually just

00:04:18.934 --> 00:04:20.968
three poodles
who'd been spray-painted.

00:04:20.968 --> 00:04:24.767
[ As Sidney Powell ]
What is the meaning of this?!

00:04:24.767 --> 00:04:26.367
But it's another thing
to get a bunch

00:04:26.367 --> 00:04:28.400
of high-level government
officials involved

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.801
and draft an actual plan

00:04:29.801 --> 00:04:32.167
and sometimes I feel like
we're going to be hearing

00:04:32.167 --> 00:04:34.501
revelations like this one
for the rest of our lives.

00:04:34.501 --> 00:04:36.100
Someday, I'll be sitting
in a nursing home,

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.701
looking out the window
at my favorite tree,

00:04:37.701 --> 00:04:40.701
and a nurse will come in
and say, "Did you hear?

00:04:40.701 --> 00:04:42.367
Trump was training
an army of rats

00:04:42.367 --> 00:04:44.434
to chew the wires
out of voting machines."

00:04:44.434 --> 00:04:45.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:45.234 --> 00:04:46.434
And, according to Politico,

00:04:46.434 --> 00:04:47.767
whoever wrote
this executive order

00:04:47.767 --> 00:04:49.701
had access to sensitive
government information

00:04:49.701 --> 00:04:50.901
that was not publicly known.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.100
Wow!
So it could've been

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.934
a high-level
government executive

00:05:04.934 --> 00:05:05.968
or a general

00:05:05.968 --> 00:05:08.033
or literally anybody
at Mar-a-Lago.

00:05:08.033 --> 00:05:09.167
Trump was pretty loose

00:05:09.167 --> 00:05:10.400
[ Laughter ]
with the top secret information.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.200
I'm sure, at least once,
he interrupted a wedding

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.100
just to read aloud
from the X-Files.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.300
[ As Trump ]
You may kiss the bride
in just a second, but, first,

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:17.801
I think you're going
to want to hear

00:05:17.801 --> 00:05:20.334
what went down at Roswell.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.334 --> 00:05:21.801
So, whoever wrote
this executive order

00:05:21.801 --> 00:05:24.801
was presumably someone who had
access to government secrets,

00:05:24.801 --> 00:05:26.133
which is pretty crazy.

00:05:26.133 --> 00:05:28.200
This time,
we just happened to get lucky,

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.634
since Trump is too dumb
to get his way

00:05:29.634 --> 00:05:31.534
and a bunch of people stopped
him by threatening to quit.

00:05:31.534 --> 00:05:34.167
But what happens next time
a Republican politician wants

00:05:34.167 --> 00:05:36.200
to use the military
to stay in power?

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.167
Are we just supposed to hope
they get distracted

00:05:38.167 --> 00:05:39.801
by an M&amp;M commercial?

00:05:39.801 --> 00:05:41.934
"I want the military
to seize voting machines

00:05:41.934 --> 00:05:43.000
and impose martial law.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:43.834
Wait a second.

00:05:43.834 --> 00:05:45.601
Who is that angelic creature?

00:05:45.601 --> 00:05:47.100
[ Laughter ]
No, wait.

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:47.834
Never mind.

00:05:47.834 --> 00:05:49.234
She's wearing flats!"

00:05:49.234 --> 00:05:51.234
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.634 --> 00:05:56.000
"Back to treason."

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.767
[ Laughter ]
And I would just like
to point out

00:05:57.767 --> 00:06:00.133
to all the people who thought
calling Trump's plan

00:06:00.133 --> 00:06:01.801
an attempted coup
was hysterical,

00:06:01.801 --> 00:06:03.367
this latest executive order is

00:06:03.367 --> 00:06:04.534
just more proof

00:06:04.534 --> 00:06:05.901
that the threat was very real.

00:06:05.901 --> 00:06:08.868
Sure, the various schemes
were easy to dismiss at the time

00:06:08.868 --> 00:06:11.701
because the people advocating
for them were known weirdos,

00:06:11.701 --> 00:06:14.334
but, it turns out, Trump was
actually listening to them.

00:06:14.334 --> 00:06:16.000
-One of the president's
visitors today,

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.167
Mike Lindell,
the founder of MyPillow,

00:06:19.167 --> 00:06:20.534
was seen over here
at the White House,

00:06:20.534 --> 00:06:21.834
outside the West Wing.

00:06:21.834 --> 00:06:23.601
A White House official
did tell me, Wolf,

00:06:23.601 --> 00:06:26.400
that it is believed that
the president and Lindell met.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.133
-A Washington Post photographer
got a close-up

00:06:29.133 --> 00:06:31.534
of the notes that he was
carrying with him and, Jake,

00:06:31.534 --> 00:06:33.400
when you zoom in on them,
you can see

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.000
that he is talking
about the election.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.734
Things like martial law
are mentioned,

00:06:37.734 --> 00:06:40.968
the words "taken immediately
to save the Constitution."

00:06:40.968 --> 00:06:43.834
-The guy from MyPillow
is carrying documents

00:06:43.834 --> 00:06:45.067
and talking
to President Trump,

00:06:45.067 --> 00:06:47.901
presumably, about declaring
martial law.

00:06:47.901 --> 00:06:49.434
-And it's easy to laugh it off
and say,

00:06:49.434 --> 00:06:51.634
"He was never going to listen
to the MyPillow guy,"

00:06:51.634 --> 00:06:53.667
but he invited him over --

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:56.868
for non-pillow reasons,
it should be noted.

00:06:56.868 --> 00:06:58.634
[ Laughter ]
I mean, if I said,
"I'm never going to take advice

00:06:58.634 --> 00:07:00.067
from Mike Lindell,"
you'd all believe me.

00:07:00.067 --> 00:07:01.968
But if I also said,
"And I told him that much

00:07:01.968 --> 00:07:04.067
at dinner last night,"
you might think, "Wait, what?"

00:07:04.067 --> 00:07:06.601
[ Laughter ]
For all we know,
they took Lindell's notes

00:07:06.601 --> 00:07:08.434
and turned them
into an executive order, too,

00:07:08.434 --> 00:07:10.267
in which case it would be
the first executive order

00:07:10.267 --> 00:07:11.667
that used a promo code.

00:07:11.667 --> 00:07:13.834
[ As Lindell ]
Enter the promo code
"Sweet Dreams"

00:07:13.834 --> 00:07:16.067
and you won't just save
the Constitution.

00:07:16.067 --> 00:07:18.734
You'll save an additional 30%.

00:07:18.734 --> 00:07:20.901
[ Laughter ]
This is yet more proof,

00:07:20.901 --> 00:07:22.133
as we've said many times,

00:07:22.133 --> 00:07:23.701
that you can be
both incredibly dumb

00:07:23.701 --> 00:07:26.000
and incredibly dangerous
at the same time.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.834
For example, Trump's cronies
also had a plan in place,

00:07:28.834 --> 00:07:31.667
at roughly the same time,
to forge fake certificates

00:07:31.667 --> 00:07:33.968
from Trump electors
in seven states Trump lost.

00:07:33.968 --> 00:07:36.133
And, of course --
and, I guess, thank God --

00:07:36.133 --> 00:07:38.501
they put their dumbest henchmen
in charge.

00:07:38.501 --> 00:07:39.567
-We have breaking news
on efforts

00:07:39.567 --> 00:07:40.901
from the former
president's allies

00:07:40.901 --> 00:07:42.667
to undermine
the 2020 election results.

00:07:42.667 --> 00:07:43.734
Now, according to sources

00:07:43.734 --> 00:07:45.467
with direct knowledge
of the scheme,

00:07:45.467 --> 00:07:48.868
Trump campaign officials,
led by Rudy Giuliani,

00:07:48.868 --> 00:07:50.567
oversaw efforts to put forward

00:07:50.567 --> 00:07:52.467
illegitimate electors
from seven states

00:07:52.467 --> 00:07:54.133
that the former president
actually lost.

00:07:54.133 --> 00:07:55.934
-It was basically
Rudy Giuliani

00:07:55.934 --> 00:07:59.367
and all these other misfits
leading the charge of this plot,

00:07:59.367 --> 00:08:01.067
intricately involved
in these efforts

00:08:01.067 --> 00:08:04.601
in December of 2020
to put forward fake electors

00:08:04.601 --> 00:08:06.801
from seven states
that Trump lost.

00:08:06.801 --> 00:08:10.100
That was a major part of this
overall plan by Team Trump

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.367
to overturn the 2020
election results,

00:08:12.367 --> 00:08:15.267
back when Congress counted the
electoral votes on January 6.

00:08:15.267 --> 00:08:17.834
So, the point was to have
Vice President Pence

00:08:17.834 --> 00:08:19.868
accept these
fake Trump electors,

00:08:19.868 --> 00:08:21.968
rather than the valid
Biden ones.

00:08:21.968 --> 00:08:23.667
One source said
there were several calls

00:08:23.667 --> 00:08:26.667
between Trump campaign officials
and state GOP operatives

00:08:26.667 --> 00:08:30.334
to round up fake electors
on a state-by-state level.

00:08:30.334 --> 00:08:32.400
-Rudy Giuliani
rounding up electors

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.067
is like an "Ocean's Eleven"
where everyone's skill was

00:08:35.067 --> 00:08:37.334
being bat[bleep] crazy.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:37.334 --> 00:08:38.801
[ As Giuliani ]
This is Nancy from Phoenix.

00:08:38.801 --> 00:08:41.467
When it comes to being a crazy,
she's got us covered.

00:08:41.467 --> 00:08:42.734
This is Frank from Tempe.

00:08:42.734 --> 00:08:45.067
When you need crazy,
he's your guy.

00:08:45.067 --> 00:08:46.367
[ Laughter ]
Patricia's from Scottsdale.

00:08:46.367 --> 00:08:47.868
She's like
an expert safecracker,

00:08:47.868 --> 00:08:49.200
but, instead of cracking safes,

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:51.367
she's being crazy.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.367 --> 00:08:52.667
Trump and his team
tried every path

00:08:52.667 --> 00:08:53.801
they could possibly think of

00:08:53.801 --> 00:08:55.267
to overturn the results
of the election

00:08:55.267 --> 00:08:57.133
and they came very close
to pulling it off.

00:08:57.133 --> 00:08:58.934
These are the kinds of schemes
they're cooking up

00:08:58.934 --> 00:09:01.767
when they're not at home,
late at night,

00:09:01.767 --> 00:09:03.968
fantasizing about M&amp;M's
[ Laughter ]

00:09:03.968 --> 00:09:05.434
while resting their heads
on their...

00:09:05.434 --> 00:09:06.634
-Pillow.

00:09:06.634 --> 00:09:08.501
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

